      "conversion": "@Redirect of the RayTraceUtil.rayTraceEntity call in ClientEvents.renderNamePlate (target-argument capture of the RenderNameTagEvent): null when the look ray stays clear of the mob's grown box by a 1e-4 margin, else rayTraceEntity's own search sequence from the eye position and ray end already computed (helper bons.furious.patch.l2hostility_plate_c49.NamePlateSight.trace); the shipped call when the switch is off or stands aside (ProjectileUtil or RayTraceUtil carries a merged mixin outside the tested set)",
      "license": "All Rights Reserved (L2 Hostility): no code is carried. LGPL-2.1 (L2 Library): NamePlateSight.trace repeats the three calls of RayTraceUtil.rayTraceEntity (getRayTerm, AABB(eye, end).inflate(1), ProjectileUtil.getEntityHitResult) with values it computed itself. Minecraft (Mojang): no-copy"
